303
00:07:13,780 --> 00:07:13,980
 Alors,

304
00:07:14,120 --> 00:07:15,600
 Mme Kanita Ahmed,

305
00:07:15,720 --> 00:07:26,940
 Madame Mayor,

306
00:07:27,380 --> 00:07:28,480
 you have clearly said

307
